{"book":"psalms","num":141,"verses":[{"en":"LORD, I cry unto thee: make haste unto me; give ear unto my voice, when I cry unto thee.","n":1,"sm":"O le tatalo ia saogalemu O le salāmo a Tavita.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tatalo"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"saogalemu"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"salāmo"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"Tavita."}]},{"en":"Let my prayer be set forth before thee as incense; and the lifting up of my hands as the evening sacrifice.","n":2,"sm":"Le ALI e, ua ou valaau atu ia te oe, ia vave Ona e afio mai ia te au;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALI"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"valaau"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"vave"},{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"afio"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"au;"}]},{"en":"Set a watch, O LORD, before my mouth; keep the door of my lips.","n":3,"sm":"faafofoga mai i loʻu leo pe a ou","w":[{"en":"","sm":"faafofoga"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"leo"},{"en":"","sm":"pe"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"}]},{"en":"Incline not my heart to any evil thing, to practise wicked works with men that work iniquity: and let me not eat of their dainties.","n":4,"sm":"valaau atu ia te oe. Ta saunia laʻu tatalo e faapei o le mea manogi e mu i ou luma;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"valaau"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe."},{"en":"","sm":"Ta"},{"en":"","sm":"saunia"},{"en":"","sm":"laʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"tatalo"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faapei"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"manogi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"mu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"luma;"}]},{"en":"Let the righteous smite me; it shall be a kindness: and let him reprove me; it shall be an excellent oil, which shall not break my head: for yet my prayer also shall be in their calamities.","n":5,"sm":"o le sii i luga o oʻu lima ia pei o le taulaga e fai i le afiafi. Le ALII e, ia e tuuina se leoleo i loʻu nei gutu,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"sii"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"luga"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"oʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"lima"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"pei"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"taulaga"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"afiafi."},{"en":"","sm":"Le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tuuina"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"leoleo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"nei"},{"en":"","sm":"gutu,"}]},{"en":"When their judges are overthrown in stony places, they shall hear my words; for they are sweet.","n":6,"sm":"ia e leoleo i le faitotoa o oʻu laugutu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"leoleo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faitotoa"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"oʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"laugutu."}]},{"en":"Our bones are scattered at the grave's mouth, as when one cutteth and cleaveth wood upon the earth.","n":7,"sm":"Aua re“ liliueseina loʻu loto i se mea leaga, ne“.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"","sm":"re“"},{"en":"","sm":"liliueseina"},{"en":"","sm":"loʻu"},{"en":"","sm":"loto"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga,"},{"en":"","sm":"ne“."}]},{"en":"But mine eyes are unto thee, O GOD the Lord: in thee is my trust; leave not my soul destitute.","n":8,"sm":"ou fai mea leaga ma le agasala faatasi ma tagata o e faia amio leaga;","w":[{"en":"","sm":"ou"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":